  "releaseNotes": "- **Disposing the host waits for its endpoints to be at rest without holding a thread.** The wait blocked the disposing thread, so a test that disposed the host while it held an observer at a gate had to dispose on a thread of its own. Requires Compze.Tessaging 0.6.4-alpha, whose at-rest wait it calls.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.7.0-internal (was 0.4.0-internal), Compze.Internals.Testing 0.2.0-alpha (was 0.1.1-alpha), Compze.Tessaging 0.6.4-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha), Compze.Threading 0.11.0-alpha (was 0.9.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
